  "content": "\n\n<h4><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yPjQ24r/Storage-Logo-2.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"120\"></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Описание:</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Добавляет блоки и предметы для хранения</span></h4>\n<h4><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1MRSg53/Storage-Logo-3.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"1013\"></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Гайд:</span></h4>\n<h4><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tCebJPopNDA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Список изменений:&nbsp;</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Обновление 2.0:</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- добавлен Вакуумный сборщик</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- изменены Бочки и Ящики</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- изменён алгоритм сортировки</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- изменён Интерфейс</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- удалены звуки</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- исправлены ошибки</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- улучшения</span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Мои моды:</span></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multipart-machines-grinding\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/drp1ksq/Logo-1-Grinding.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multipart-machines-farming\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fSFZyq9/Farming-Logo-1.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multipart-machines-cooking\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wJNfyYx/Logo-1-Cooking.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multipart-machines-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2Kdp0WQ/Storage-Logo-1.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multipart-machines-mining\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pJKp55c/Mining-Logo-1.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Нравятся мои моды? Поддержите мою разработку</span></h4>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fgrabolit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7p3PNRk/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"99\"></a></p>",
